#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/components/onboarding_flow.html:87
msgid ""
"This AI advisor learns from your facility over time. During the initial "
"learning period, advice is based on general agricultural knowledge and "
"may not be specific to your conditions. Your feedback — confirming, "
"adjusting, or rejecting suggestions — is what calibrates the system to "
"your facility. The system will tell you when it is uncertain and what "
"confirmation would help. You remain in control: no automated actions will"
" be taken without your approval."
msgstr "Ce conseiller IA apprend progressivement de votre installation. Pendant la période d'apprentissage initiale, les conseils s'appuient sur des connaissances agricoles générales et peuvent ne pas correspondre précisément à vos conditions. Vos retours — en confirmant, ajustant ou rejetant les suggestions — sont ce qui calibre le système sur votre installation. Le système vous indiquera quand il est incertain et quelle confirmation l'aiderait. Vous gardez le contrôle : aucune action automatisée ne sera entreprise sans votre approbation."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/components/onboarding_flow.html:91
msgid "I understand and agree to the above terms"
msgstr "Je comprends et j'accepte les conditions ci-dessus"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/components/onboarding_flow.html:96
msgid "Agree and Start"
msgstr "Accepter et commencer"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/components/onboarding_flow.html:106
msgid "Onboarding Complete"
msgstr "Intégration terminée"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/components/onboarding_flow.html:107
msgid ""
"The AI advisor will begin learning about this facility. The more feedback"
" you provide on its suggestions, the more accurate and customized the "
"advice becomes."
msgstr "Le conseiller IA va commencer à apprendre les caractéristiques de cette installation. Plus vous fournissez de retours sur ses suggestions, plus les conseils deviennent précis et personnalisés."

